{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_084_title", "source_sha256": "aa5f595b4625357099db9272ee7b140bbd0ac43ece3cd48b8aca2b132a1dd6ba", "ja": "オレと君へのエール", "zh": "献给我和你的加油声", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_084_synopsis", "source_sha256": "2c9b9b9ad6581b02e4ce8838eda97d174ef88a302267d061de116e0e64c02b8e", "ja": "公演が兄の引退試合と重なってしまった昴。\n張り切る兄を前に中々言い出せずにいたが、\nプロデューサーに背中を押され正直に話すと\n兄に笑い飛ばされる。「お互い、いい試合に\nしよう」と約束し、昴はステージに向かう。", "zh": "演出恰好和哥哥的引退赛撞期的昴。\n面对干劲十足的哥哥，她一直开不了口，\n但在制作人的鼓励下坦诚相告后，\n反倒被哥哥付之一笑。“彼此都要打出一场\n精彩的比赛”，做出这番约定后，昴走向了舞台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_084_1000_p", "source_sha256": "622510e8af4cac0698b1615b45718f3d6ab98cdfecb6e1b205cb8dda0b032b99", "ja": "（そろそろ、定期公演の内容を告知する時期だ。\n新曲を入れるか決めたいところだけど、昴は……）", "zh": "（差不多该公布定期公演的内容了。虽然也该决定要不要加入新歌，但昴她……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_084_1001_047sub", "source_sha256": "eaabd4e23ed2b62dcbcd9ce142a95937c03d64f48b77313310c2c5176e8ed308", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}！\nお、おはよ……。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！\n早、早上好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_084_1002_p", "source_sha256": "208f40673b79c79020ce6bfa155142a4720d6553fb295212b8ea37f861422ad8", "ja": "おはよう、昴。ちょうどよかった。\n定期公演の事なんだけど、お兄さんとは話せたか？", "zh": "早上好，昴。正好。\n关于定期公演的事，你和哥哥谈过了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_084_1003_047sub", "source_sha256": "4c1557af100e7d6d70471885694f2ddddd1bbfcc227fa20dc700f022dcbb0e0c", "ja": "えっと、それが……ごめん！\nオレ、まだ兄ちゃんと、話せてなくて……。", "zh": "那个……对不起！\n我还没能和哥哥说上话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_084_1004_p", "source_sha256": "f91117849bc6dbd0dba371f1151853f5414dec3673e0c70d5b5a417d3001d329", "ja": "そうか……だったら、先に\n歌のレッスンだけ始めておくか？", "zh": "这样啊……那要不先开始上声乐课？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_084_1005_p", "source_sha256": "afa2134772591d41fb9e56f7c80a21d97c5b0657934a07cc93630e83c6b8bfa3", "ja": "公演が先になっても、レコーディングもあるし。\n何より、あの曲は昴の新曲だからな！", "zh": "就算演出提前了，也还有录音要做。\n更重要的是，那可是昴的新歌啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_084_1006_047sub", "source_sha256": "58761aeff67c50d274c4f3ae2d38a8dc8c42f54908a5a5be046175f2635f6b85", "ja": "{$P$}……うん、わかった！\nオレ、がんばるよ！", "zh": "{$P$}……嗯，知道了！\n我会加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_084_1008_047sub", "source_sha256": "b7d631994c653c6cfbae4bfe333453fd75096b07656ce9911548759b84aa39b0", "ja": "ららら～ららら、ららら～♪\nららら、ららら、らららら、ら～……♪", "zh": "啦啦啦～啦啦啦，啦啦啦～♪\n啦啦啦，啦啦啦，啦啦啦啦，啦～……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_084_1009_p", "source_sha256": "7415e9294409112d28a300dd7a9d5b03654f74cbbd2c292064e9d6996d39f445", "ja": "（音はちゃんと取れてるし、\n最初にしてはよく歌えてるな。けど……）", "zh": "（音都唱准了，而且第一次唱就唱得很好。不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_084_1010_047sub", "source_sha256": "8f734d45ca572478460fa05276d606dd5c6dc56242e665185adb00b8056b9943", "ja": "う～ん……？　なあ、{$P$}！\nなんかオレ、変じゃない？", "zh": "嗯～……？喂，{$P$}！\n总觉得我是不是有点不对劲？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_084_1011_047sub", "source_sha256": "58879ce7525fd2d36d7a40e5d5bec1ed525832c3d76438cf8cac25ece6e90b1a", "ja": "家でちゃんと、練習してきたんだけどな～。\nなんか、ちっともうまく歌えてないっていうか……。", "zh": "明明在家好好练习过了呀～。\n总觉得，一点都唱不好……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_084_1012_p", "source_sha256": "72ddd16794b85a4c3c220c87925ba45f5eb2b6055de69a3a1512b1046db029ec", "ja": "そうだな……昴にしては、\nいつもの元気さが感じられないというか……。", "zh": "是啊……对昴来说，\n总觉得少了平时那股活力……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_084_1013_005yay", "source_sha256": "9df62a449fbaf0097a04e48ef17d4aa09d6bda3a34544b715bed6a11aaa86410", "ja": "昴さん、{$P$}！\nお疲れさまですっ！", "zh": "昴姐，{$P$}！\n辛苦啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_084_1014_p", "source_sha256": "7544c39298a148182eee3f3301d83eed76f18d8a0fdfcbd697b91bb66c06aa18", "ja": "あれ、やよい？\nエミリーに、可奈とひなたも一緒か。", "zh": "咦，弥生？\n艾米莉、可奈和日向也一起吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_084_1015_047sub", "source_sha256": "c27918877c2e1ec147d8df76b291f66eec75bcdb750ac4525fd347dbfc36114c", "ja": "お疲れ！　みんな、どうしたんだ？\n今日はレッスンなかったよな？", "zh": "辛苦了！大家这是怎么了？\n今天不是没有练习吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_084_1016_032emi", "source_sha256": "3bd81976b6eef576cc18c22cae8c0c328fa869b161961570385110947fdddc14", "ja": "はい。ですが、昴さんが歌の稽古中と聞いたので……\n僭越ながら、応援の助太刀に参りました。", "zh": "是的。不过听说昴小姐正在练歌……\n所以我就冒昧前来，为她加油助阵了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_084_1017_035hin", "source_sha256": "5d35943c6206a127a4c7a41097fc3ca328bebbbbe65e4b46930183e51210a9d8", "ja": "あたしたちも、同じステージに立つんだもの。\n昴さん、できることがあったら、何でも言ってねぇ。", "zh": "我们也要站上同一个舞台嘛。\n昴，要是有什么我们能帮上的，就尽管告诉我们哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_084_1018_047sub", "source_sha256": "b610d779ecba95f4df39ae96f19d65d03605e4ae3670c8a775d3571cffab6980", "ja": "みんな……うん、サンキュな！　と言っても、\nまだ始めたばっかだから、特に思いつかないけど。", "zh": "大家……嗯，谢啦！话虽这么说，\n不过才刚开始，我也想不到有什么特别需要帮忙的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_084_1019_005yay", "source_sha256": "bffee91765c989f9648fa490218109fd8d168bb76d8fb5f3a5ccd5b1c7acc1ff", "ja": "私、美咲さんからいろいろ預かってきたんです。\n休憩したくなったら、お茶をどうぞ！", "zh": "我从美咲那里带来了好多东西。\n想休息的时候，请喝茶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_084_1020_036kan", "source_sha256": "efdad596a8a7cebc16f627b30d18275fd946feeb0fc106032306e3396a09c8af", "ja": "それと、これ！　私のおすすめの、のど飴です！\nレッスンのおともにどうぞ♪", "zh": "还有这个！这是我推荐的润喉糖！\n请在练习时吃吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_084_1021_035hin", "source_sha256": "b0d20211835e27ba77d398f44ea0f50156edeedebbd1c19e1fabbd75901dd05c", "ja": "あたしは、梅干しを持ってきたよぉ。\n疲れたときに食べてねぇ。", "zh": "我还带了梅干来哦。\n累的时候记得吃呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_084_1022_047sub", "source_sha256": "f5a7dd6c32080d9dccf4190df7749e1560d7a77755c4b50d3be0d33485850fde", "ja": "え、いいの！？\nやったー、サンキュ♪", "zh": "诶，可以吗！？\n太好了——谢谢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_084_1023_047sub", "source_sha256": "96cadb60cf61388c954718a1905becfa3e50ab2b96667fc521374ead8e414ad7", "ja": "オレ、みんなとのステージ、すっげー楽しみだよ。\nレッスンがんばらないとなー。", "zh": "我特别期待和大家一起登台。\n得加油练习才行啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_084_1024_036kan", "source_sha256": "762a290abf615f3e63ffcbd6cff24bbf76a0fa37bb2fbd4d6b7f43f8ae6d88a5", "ja": "ふれーふれー、昴さん♪\nがんばれがんばれ、昴さん～♪　えへ♪", "zh": "加油加油，昴前辈♪\n努力努力，昴前辈～♪嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_084_1025_035hin", "source_sha256": "31ecb807f2f04ee6e8432ff310c3b3a51bc2d3fd6afd9ab1eb660b2f55662a49", "ja": "かっとばせー、ファイヤー！　だべさ♪", "zh": "挥棒吧——加油！就是这样♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_084_1026_005yay", "source_sha256": "548e804f7a0b4c9cc0794aa0b13687a1faa534af33744f4ec5c62d4e4bda7598", "ja": "かっとばせー、ファイヤー！　えへへ♪\nなんか、野球の応援みたいですね！", "zh": "使劲打——火焰！嘿嘿♪\n感觉好像在给棒球加油呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_084_1027_032emi", "source_sha256": "88d0461dc70dbcd20be23a374f16243bc509ccce128cfc1cd3a2554bfabf7538", "ja": "かっとばせー、炎……？", "zh": "打出去吧，火焰……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_084_1028_null", "source_sha256": "c710de22af2d5a9636c0d1f4b65c3da75cb1bbc836b3f6ef923b9d5b8acddf22", "ja": "レッスン終了後……", "zh": "练习结束后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_084_1029_047sub", "source_sha256": "ba1ce57f565867eec24e1d188ee0274d94dad8748be41275c2d47f11208a008f", "ja": "みんなが応援しに来てくれるなんて思わなかったな～。\nオレ、すっげー気合い入った！", "zh": "没想到大家会特意来给我加油啊～。\n我一下子干劲十足了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_084_1030_047sub", "source_sha256": "14704d0ce4d7ade167422ff9d3ee1e1c16215504754586ec289b3994f7a8d372", "ja": "お茶とかお菓子の差し入れも、女の子っぽいしさ♪\nやっぱチームっていいよな～。", "zh": "连茶和点心这种慰问品都很有女孩子的感觉嘛♪\n果然还是团队好啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_084_1031_047sub", "source_sha256": "0d4a1db111520b35e76c2a4e8cff1411a30464ba9bdd9e1ce3100f09bf3fdafd", "ja": "あっ、差し入れのお菓子残ってる。食べよーっと。\n{$P$}、どれにする？", "zh": "啊，慰劳品点心还剩着呢。我吃啦～\n{$P$}，你选哪个？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_084_1032_p", "source_sha256": "6b80d8120c09bf4872e3c951a185a8e1e87aeb8df14c23eeab16b2c7719b60ed", "ja": "そうだな……あ、昴。\nお菓子を食べながらでいいから、少し話せるか？", "zh": "这么说来……啊，昴。\n你可以一边吃点心，一边和我聊几句吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_084_1033_047sub", "source_sha256": "d500f4f2026bd9162515ce80713a4f23ee510f2ff22bc2d5082207f4966aa02f", "ja": "え？　う、うん。\nでも、なんだよ急に……改まって。", "zh": "诶？　嗯、嗯。\n不过，怎么突然……这么郑重其事的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_084_1034_p", "source_sha256": "7f8d6f3bd43198d02bee7b440722ddc40bb53e85c5643ddc2b9e9bf6c0714368", "ja": "単刀直入に聞くけど……。昴、今度の公演の事で、\n何か困ってないか？　……お兄さんの事か？", "zh": "我就直截了当地问了……昴，关于下次的公演，你是不是遇到什么麻烦了？……是你哥哥的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_084_1035_p", "source_sha256": "8b1af63e878c7607990784128cb07d0104bbe3c380a3f1f2904d804d94ca5d2e", "ja": "無理にとは言わないけど、困ってるなら遠慮しないで\n話して欲しい。俺も、チームの一員なんだからな。", "zh": "我不是要勉强你，不过要是遇到了什么困难，就别客气，跟我说说吧。毕竟我也是团队的一员。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_084_1036_047sub", "source_sha256": "314217948255f74276c0110774689a0541cb54bb0dfc6ba577bfe656c2b3fb6a", "ja": "あっ……そっか。オレたちが選手なら、\n{$P$}は監督みたいなもんだよな。", "zh": "啊……这样啊。要是我们是选手，那{$P$}就算是教练了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_084_1037_047sub", "source_sha256": "0fa3ac5898a745c7b950d93ab81b91898424f8f530addda420dc32378d452d2c", "ja": "えっと……昨夜オレ、兄ちゃんに話そうとしたんだ。\n引退試合の日に、定期公演があるってこと……。", "zh": "那个……昨晚我本来想告诉哥哥的。\n就是在退役比赛那天，还有定期公演这件事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_084_1038_047sub", "source_sha256": "43689156c8e5006c057e943ee35f57126c22834b1238fa691238d0ee043e33dc", "ja": "けど兄ちゃん、「絶対ホームラン打つ！」とか言って\nさ～！　オレ、なんか言い出せなくなっちゃって……。", "zh": "可是哥哥说着“我一定会打出全垒打！”之类的话，\n所以嘛～！我就怎么也说不出口了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_084_1039_047sub", "source_sha256": "b8fc1dc7d9a5d61b1734fc6c1900fa59e660d2e6ae3be9dedb02f36a050803b5", "ja": "「ホームランボール、キャッチしてもいいからな♪」\n……じゃないっての！　もう、兄ちゃんのバカーっ！", "zh": "还说什么“本垒打球，你想接也是可以的哦♪”\n……才不是那样呢！真是的，笨蛋老哥——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_084_1040_p", "source_sha256": "08553cbc88125b22c12d3b41cf87afcbe966e47f03d8889e3f1a394f40422cd0", "ja": "はは……なるほど。\nそれは確かに、切り出しづらいな。", "zh": "哈哈……原来如此。\n那确实很难开口啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_084_1041_047sub", "source_sha256": "9aa41c42b18a913d4f05e81aea8f907beca571a24acab5a3230a95a69dc9d7d9", "ja": "そうなんだよ！　楽しみにしてろって言われて、\nオレ、何て答えていいかわかんなくなっちゃって。", "zh": "就是啊！被说“等着期待吧”，我都不知道该怎么回答了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_084_1042_047sub", "source_sha256": "1a359067f98f243fed1554890d947466d2d8502e1ed06bab5ab3363fbfa64a97", "ja": "なー、{$P$}。\nオレ、どうしたらいいのかな～……？", "zh": "呐，{$P$}。\n我到底该怎么办才好呢～……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_084_1043_p", "source_sha256": "a564af40509ec022eab0c345085e07de618200d95931654b7058da1d5cad9adc", "ja": "うーん、俺の希望を言うのは簡単だけど……多分、\n昴自身が決めないといけない事なんじゃないかな。", "zh": "嗯——说出我的希望很简单，但是……我觉得，这大概是必须由昴自己做决定的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_084_1044_p", "source_sha256": "9cd6d47af347d406c47b332b272f2560516948ad1a062dc89faa81a3580193cc", "ja": "でも、これだけは言えるよ。お兄さんならきっと、\n昴がどんな答えを出しても、受け入れてくれるって。", "zh": "不过，这一点我可以肯定。要是那位哥哥的话，无论昴最后做出什么决定，他一定都会接受的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_084_1045_047sub", "source_sha256": "9d2fd615a896bd73e04808acf3caa10ceab23ba63d81cc4a5c84b6e3da13dd5a", "ja": "受け入れてくれる……どうして？", "zh": "会接纳我……为什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_084_1046_p", "source_sha256": "cf29724d951132ea70013916b463107072d38c436582223028e1ebe1a7b9b09d", "ja": "自分の引退試合なのに、昴やみんなを\n楽しませる事を一番に考えてるんだろう？", "zh": "明明是自己的退役比赛，却把让昴和大家开心放在第一位吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_084_1047_p", "source_sha256": "bb7f2a5a4dcbad33d39c725b2323d7606f6c7db4b2f56b5c8e35f74825ea0982", "ja": "誰かのために、頑張れる人なんだな。\nそういうところ、昴と似てると思うし……。", "zh": "是个能为了别人拼命努力的人啊。这一点，我觉得和昴挺像的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_084_1048_047sub", "source_sha256": "e75cbe9d57a6f1637e18e75890b6f643c1e08fc1ebbf0db0f4a7de0e20b47676", "ja": "えっ、似てるって？　バカなとこ？", "zh": "诶？你说像我？是说我笨笨的这点吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_084_1049_p", "source_sha256": "e7b7f4e01290e7b141670e78721a7091e888e985b27718e3441ffb674f3b3e29", "ja": "そうじゃなくて……\n誰かのために、頑張れるってところだよ。", "zh": "不是那个意思……\n而是你们都能为了别人努力这一点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_084_1050_p", "source_sha256": "26d934697bef02b5bf8b204c3050f04de029f376ec5c895478b9ca02128164a5", "ja": "昴だって、ステージを見てくれるファンの人のために、\nいつも頑張ってるだろ？", "zh": "昴也一样，你不是一直都在为那些观看演出的粉丝们努力着吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_084_1051_047sub", "source_sha256": "cdf8ff675f885019a0c49d9405ddfd75f69af2bb0cee4d07efdfae92ccb460e4", "ja": "オレと兄ちゃんが似てる、かぁ。\n考えたことなかったけど……。", "zh": "我和哥哥很像吗？\n虽然以前从没想过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_084_1052_p", "source_sha256": "1bb4c288abbc65d4f39c8c8036f02847636d4556e0b6afe367ab36add02bb98b", "ja": "それに昴がそんなに悩んでいるのも、\nどっちを優先するべきかって事だろうから。", "zh": "而且，昴之所以这么烦恼，应该也是因为不知道该优先哪一边吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_084_1053_p", "source_sha256": "2517e2376280cda7cdeeadf2c3886e3114fe831ed3ed8295025f56dab5d8eeff", "ja": "昴はアイドルとして、ファンの人達に対して、責任感を\n持って行動しているんだ。すごい成長だと思うよ。", "zh": "昴作为偶像，对粉丝们怀有责任感，并以此为准则行动。我觉得这是非常了不起的成长。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_084_1055_047sub", "source_sha256": "d8ba93f2591c9be05cf72f69e1104c3ad573012eb385c03fa2e237d21b3f1e1b", "ja": "でも……だったら、今、\nオレがしなきゃいけないことは、やっぱり……。", "zh": "不过……既然这样，那现在我必须做的事，果然还是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_084_1056_p", "source_sha256": "3a15c43f9d9074c3a1a9babf51a88c3e13aef6e3fb9c5ca2daf8af445d501f18", "ja": "昴、新曲の披露公演は延期できるけど、お兄さんの\n引退試合は一度きりだ。優先してもいいんだぞ？", "zh": "昴，新曲的首演可以延期，但哥哥的退役比赛只有一次。你可以优先去的，知道吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_084_1057_047sub", "source_sha256": "78644e3c9d5f64cc09454a542bffa3f794f3909761b7ff3f79d385cee3bdab8d", "ja": "あ、待って、{$P$}！", "zh": "啊，等等，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_084_1058_047sub", "source_sha256": "e3741efa4ad7f982755d5597e0953dc4345b56b1fcf2dd6e5391dc0d6e5cf468", "ja": "オレ……今度こそ、兄ちゃんと話してくる！\nちゃんと話して、それで……納得してもらいたい！", "zh": "我……这次一定会去和哥哥谈谈！\n好好谈谈，然后……希望能让他理解！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_084_1059_047sub", "source_sha256": "72357bd6fb022d0537014251a2baa81469c7eea6fbfdf9db61b001b1c9719886", "ja": "だから、もう1日だけくれない？\n今日絶対話してくるから！　お願い！", "zh": "所以，再给我1天，好不好？\n我今天一定会去跟他说的！拜托了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_084_1060_p", "source_sha256": "659231eccd7d023e761190cc09f7a7c0e667cf3312530dfcdebe5bb44fdb9c4a", "ja": "わかった、待ってるよ。\nどっちにしろ、後悔しないようにな。", "zh": "我知道了，我会等你的。\n无论结果如何，都别让自己留下遗憾啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_084_1061_047sub", "source_sha256": "b537ea1d4df7aa0dd4b6a02c0955b1120258b844e6153cc9b960ea3c53cebc32", "ja": "うん！\nありがと、{$P$}！", "zh": "嗯！\n谢谢你，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_084_1063_047sub", "source_sha256": "4da6b16fbd39b2bb9c916b17cb474d8239c3e30a96e38fb09eeb60b3e389a6d5", "ja": "颯太兄ちゃんは……あ、いたいた。", "zh": "飒太哥哥……啊，在那儿呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_084_1064_047sub", "source_sha256": "5e3b85d0fbb0d1e8f0e3fed28a022d91422f1e23b46b19370d64dbf99e5defd1", "ja": "ミットの手入れしてんのか。……この姿も、\n引退したらもう、見られなくなるんだよな。", "zh": "你在保养手套啊。……我这副模样，等退役后，也就再也看不到了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_084_1065_047sub", "source_sha256": "cdedb1f20555e443a9f34e5240743149151348c80c992954dd8053c16a755718", "ja": "でも……{$P$}と約束したんだ。\nオレ、自分の気持ち、ちゃんと言わなきゃ……！", "zh": "可是……我已经和{$P$}约好了。  \n我必须好好说出自己的心情……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_084_1066_047sub", "source_sha256": "6dd773f957077fe1b92bbdd26f91ef8d688226122ef5db61ee609398e3bad2e6", "ja": "そ、颯太兄ちゃん！　ちょっといい？", "zh": "颯太哥哥！那个，方便吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_084_1067_souta", "source_sha256": "e353e9f6b07f17ce9d95653a667486bbd0e2ca8cf98186245129e3db0da45fb6", "ja": "おう。どうした、昴。\nキャッチボールでもしたいのか？", "zh": "哦。怎么了，昴。\n想玩传接球吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_084_1068_047sub", "source_sha256": "6c509af9d570967d0ebbf30f1eeedaf86be5920728e3e540632c9157d0a17d88", "ja": "えっ、するする！　……じゃなくて！\nそれはあとでいいからさ、えっと……。", "zh": "诶？要打要打！……不对！\n那个之后再说啦，那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_084_1069_047sub", "source_sha256": "974223566d18a863ab6a3becf2c1ca2a9bbd8406292bb1e7603a75d0fba194f8", "ja": "実はさ、オレ、新曲をもらったんだ。それで今度、\nお披露目公演をすることになったんだけど……。", "zh": "其实啊，我拿到新歌了。然后下次\n要举办发表公演，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_084_1070_047sub", "source_sha256": "1ee3e118ca562f1949d58b50c027025b899051b73eee23509368c5fa02393a54", "ja": "その公演っていうのがさ……\nに、兄ちゃんの引退試合と同じ日で……。", "zh": "说起那场演出啊……\n和、和哥哥退役比赛是同一天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
